//   setup: C3's high goes above C2's high. That is not a new definition invented for a
//   label - it is the same event InvalidateConfirmed already treats as the end of a setup
//   and reports as FC2, and the comparisons here use the same STRICT operators the engine
//   does (low < c2 / high > c2), so the tag and the FC2 alert can never disagree about
//   whether a setup broke.
//   No new detection and no engine coupling. The test is two values already sitting in
//   the lane's own price arrays, evaluated where the tag is drawn.
